  "question": {
    "text": "The term independent of <math><mi>x</mi></math> in the expansion of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
